#: ../../installation.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalación"

#: ../../installation.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide covers the full setup process for running RELAC TX on a "
"Windows machine."
msgstr "Esta guía cubre el proceso completo de configuración para ejecutar RELAC TX en una máquina Windows."

#: ../../installation.md:5
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos del sistema"

#: ../../installation.md:7
msgid "**Operating System:** Windows 10 or higher"
msgstr "**Sistema operativo:** Windows 10 o superior"

#: ../../installation.md:8
msgid "**Git:** [Git for Windows](https://gitforwindows.org/) (version 2.40+)"
msgstr "**Git:** [Git for Windows](https://gitforwindows.org/) (versión 2.40+)"

#: ../../installation.md:9
msgid ""
"**Python distribution:** "
"[Miniconda](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) or "
"[Anaconda](https://www.anaconda.com/download)"
msgstr "**Distribución de Python:** [Miniconda](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) o [Anaconda](https://www.anaconda.com/download)"

#: ../../installation.md:10
msgid "**Solver:** At least one of the following LP/MIP solvers:"
msgstr "**Solver:** Al menos uno de los siguientes solvers LP/MIP:"

#: ../../installation.md:11
msgid ""
"[GLPK](https://www.gnu.org/software/glpk/) (open source, **installed "
"automatically** with the Conda environment)"
msgstr "[GLPK](https://www.gnu.org/software/glpk/) (código abierto, **se instala automáticamente** con el entorno Conda)"

#: ../../installation.md:12
msgid ""
"[CBC](https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc) (open source, **installed "
"automatically** with the Conda environment)"
msgstr "[CBC](https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc) (código abierto, **se instala automáticamente** con el entorno Conda)"

#: ../../installation.md:13
msgid ""
"[CPLEX](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) "
"(commercial, IBM)"
msgstr "[CPLEX](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) (comercial, IBM)"

#: ../../installation.md:14
msgid "[Gurobi](https://www.gurobi.com/) (commercial, free academic license)"
msgstr "[Gurobi](https://www.gurobi.com/) (comercial, licencia académica gratuita)"

#: ../../installation.md:16
msgid "Clone the Repository"
