#: ../../installation.md:55
msgid "Solver Setup"
msgstr "Configuración del solver"

#: ../../installation.md:57
msgid "GLPK and CBC (included in the environment)"
msgstr "GLPK y CBC (incluidos en el entorno)"

#: ../../installation.md:59
msgid ""
"Both open-source solvers are declared in `environment.yaml` (`glpk` and "
"`coincbc`), so they are installed together with the Conda environment. No"
" extra step is needed for a fresh environment."
msgstr "Ambos solvers de código abierto están declarados en `environment.yaml` (`glpk` y `coincbc`), por lo que se instalan junto con el entorno Conda. No se necesita ningún paso adicional para un entorno nuevo."

#: ../../installation.md:61
msgid ""
"If your `OG-MOMF-env` was created before the solvers were added, `run.py`"
" detects the missing `glpsol`/`cbc` binaries and installs them on its "
"next run. You can also do it manually:"
msgstr "Si su `OG-MOMF-env` se creó antes de que se agregaran los solvers, `run.py` detecta los binarios `glpsol`/`cbc` faltantes y los instala en su siguiente ejecución. También puede hacerlo manualmente:"

#: ../../installation.md:67
msgid ""
"Note: the binaries live inside the environment (`...\\envs\\OG-MOMF-"
"env\\Library\\bin`), so they are only on `PATH` when the environment is "
"active (or when running through `conda run`, as `run.py` does)."
msgstr "Nota: los binarios residen dentro del entorno (`...\\envs\\OG-MOMF-env\\Library\\bin`), por lo que solo están en `PATH` cuando el entorno está activo (o al ejecutarse mediante `conda run`, como hace `run.py`)."

#: ../../installation.md:69
msgid "CPLEX"
msgstr "CPLEX"

#: ../../installation.md:71
msgid ""
"Install IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio from the [IBM "
"website](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio)."
msgstr "Instale IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio desde el [sitio web de IBM](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio)."

#: ../../installation.md:72
msgid "Ensure the `cplex` binary is available on your system `PATH`."
msgstr "Asegúrese de que el binario `cplex` esté disponible en el `PATH` de su sistema."

#: ../../installation.md:73
msgid "Set `solver: 'cplex'` in `inputs/config/Config_MOMF_T1_AB.yaml`."
msgstr "Configure `solver: 'cplex'` en `inputs/config/Config_MOMF_T1_AB.yaml`."

#: ../../installation.md:75
msgid "Gurobi"
msgstr "Gurobi"

#: ../../installation.md:77
msgid ""
"Install Gurobi from the [Gurobi "
"website](https://www.gurobi.com/downloads/)."
msgstr "Instale Gurobi desde el [sitio web de Gurobi](https://www.gurobi.com/downloads/)."

#: ../../installation.md:78
msgid "Activate your license (`grbgetkey <license-key>`)."
msgstr "Active su licencia (`grbgetkey <license-key>`)."

#: ../../installation.md:79
msgid "Ensure the `gurobi` binary is available on your system `PATH`."
msgstr "Asegúrese de que el binario `gurobi` esté disponible en el `PATH` de su sistema."

#: ../../installation.md:80
msgid "Set `solver: 'gurobi'` in `inputs/config/Config_MOMF_T1_AB.yaml`."
msgstr "Configure `solver: 'gurobi'` en `inputs/config/Config_MOMF_T1_AB.yaml`."

